    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh doctor visits are such a hassle and honestly so expensive. if i just take some extra ibuprofen to help with the throbbing and use a bunch of neosporin, i feel like i'm being pretty responsible. if it doesn't start swelling out or turning red by tomorrow, can i just consider it handled? i really don't think i need a whole professional cleaning for a tiny scratch, even if it's a bit deep.",
